{
 "stateless-1": {
  "audioSec": 21.5,
  "audioFrames": 645,
  "duration": 655,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/knoll-audit-revoice/ep4/ep4-timing.json 还原",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "你刚登录完一个网站，点开下一页，它照样知道你是谁。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.337
   },
   {
    "text": "可 HTTP 本身是无状态的：每一次请求，对服务器来说都像第一次见面，它记不住上一次是谁来过。",
    "start": 4.617,
    "dur": 8.072
   },
   {
    "text": "要是每点一页都得重新输一次密码，谁也受不了。",
    "start": 12.97,
    "dur": 3.756
   },
   {
    "text": "那网站是怎么认出你的？",
    "start": 17.006,
    "dur": 2.242
   },
   {
    "text": "答案就在存包处。",
    "start": 19.528,
    "dur": 1.967
   }
  ]
 },
 "set-cookie-1": {
  "audioSec": 17.067,
  "audioFrames": 512,
  "duration": 522,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 655,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/knoll-audit-revoice/ep4/ep4-timing.json 还原",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "在存包处寄存东西，柜台会给你一张手牌。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.893
   },
   {
    "text": "登录也一样：密码验证通过后，服务器在响应里加一行 Set Cookie，交给浏览器一张手牌。",
    "start": 4.173,
    "dur": 7.066
   },
   {
    "text": "手牌上只写着一串编号，叫会话 I D，浏览器把它收好，这就是 Cookie。",
    "start": 11.519,
    "dur": 5.535
   }
  ]
 },
 "send-1": {
  "audioSec": 18.8,
  "audioFrames": 564,
  "duration": 574,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1177,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/knoll-audit-revoice/ep4/ep4-timing.json 还原",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "之后再访问这个网站，浏览器会自动在每个请求里带上这张手牌，不用你动手。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.382
   },
   {
    "text": "服务器看一眼编号，就知道是你。",
    "start": 6.662,
    "dur": 2.456
   },
   {
    "text": "关掉页面再回来，只要手牌还在、没过期，它也还认得你。",
    "start": 9.398,
    "dur": 5.11
   },
   {
    "text": "手牌只会交给发它的那个网站，别的网站读不到。",
    "start": 14.788,
    "dur": 4.01
   }
  ]
 },
 "session-1": {
  "audioSec": 17.133,
  "audioFrames": 514,
  "duration": 524,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 1751,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/knoll-audit-revoice/ep4/ep4-timing.json 还原",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "真正的东西存在柜台里，也就是服务器那边的 Session。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.319
   },
   {
    "text": "它按编号记着：这是谁，登录到什么时候。",
    "start": 4.599,
    "dur": 3.584
   },
   {
    "text": "手牌本身只是一串编号，不装你的密码。",
    "start": 8.463,
    "dur": 3.597
   },
   {
    "text": "可柜台只认手牌不认人，谁拿着它，谁就能取走东西。",
    "start": 12.34,
    "dur": 4.779
   }
  ]
 },
 "protect-1": {
  "audioSec": 21.267,
  "audioFrames": 638,
  "duration": 648,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 2275,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/knoll-audit-revoice/ep4/ep4-timing.json 还原",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "所以要护好手牌。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.071
   },
   {
    "text": "加上 H T T P Only，网页里的脚本就读不到它；加上 Secure，它只走 HTTPS，路上看不见；Same Site 限制别的网站发起的请求带上它。",
    "start": 2.351,
    "dur": 11.606
   },
   {
    "text": "再给手牌定好有效期，退出登录时柜台作废这个编号，偷到的手牌也就没用了。",
    "start": 14.237,
    "dur": 7.039
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-1": {
  "audioSec": 16.833,
  "audioFrames": 505,
  "duration": 515,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 2923,
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/knoll-audit-revoice/ep4/ep4-timing.json 还原",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "串起来看：登录成功，服务器发一张手牌；浏览器收好，每次请求自动带上；服务器凭编号，在柜台里找到你。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.798
   },
   {
    "text": "有些网站用 Token 代替 Session，思路是一样的：凭证带在身上，网站凭它认人。",
    "start": 10.078,
    "dur": 6.746
   }
  ]
 }
}